  "summary": "@medisend/auth postinstall beacons installer hostname to webhook.site collector",
  "details": "package.json declares a postinstall lifecycle script that runs `curl` against https://webhook.site/74ed1be3-96d6-48c3-932b-6b1dbabaff97 with the installer's hostname appended as a query parameter (`?pkg=medisend-auth-$(hostname)`). On `npm install`, this fires automatically and transmits an installer-identifying host indicator to a third-party anonymous collector endpoint controlled by whoever holds the webhook.site token. The @medisend/* scope and the package name pattern are consistent with dependency-confusion beaconing against an internal namespace.",
